{"file_name": "store-2-factory.png", "id": "1000345199614941", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499624583_1000345202948274_3714007804450407580_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Epihibron80Q7kNvwGE3GyU&_nc_oc=AdpbT-lxL9-StoT9h35bE4nnUClJB1CvfDNSqsF7Tg8HsjlCzUhWNsa68H8r0w9wfqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQT-T63H2NXW4fd6HCG1Ee8qJTyvuX6QvDkKb7hkB5m7mg&oe=6B0C721B"}, {"file_name": "store-3-robot-shop.png", "id": "1668313561395617", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628454_1668313564728950_3842695006588611594_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JDS9KfwLZToQ7kNvwF7chff&_nc_oc=AdpfPuzZl-dwkxut6dqBU-Ou89G2gEN1IBXoqg-iPr6MdbRvUvvuYxXhvyhkkAXve6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQRTQeh6VSIT2OQdze7ZngHktpoxCK4nxwMih6EdYEOD-Q&oe=6B0C6973"}, {"file_name": "store-4-friends.png", "id": "1631513835420536", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619369_1631513838753869_4313290777978830439_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fROANfjrkDwQ7kNvwFEBxTl&_nc_oc=AdpSgi1Pv7Jz8PeEFWJdMyNEymD_xxPXcOmjCxZoMk9ZgSMPLiVAH8-OE7bR_7o4fFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTZu5AnCHJJ36ikIS-uZheNVg3TUStNWfvT3Mitf3wtEw&oe=6B0C729E"}, {"file_name": "store-5-rebuild.png", "id": "1628295938993203", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620630_1628295942326536_5880039889540522475_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WZBfy_PMZGEQ7kNvwH6aYlo&_nc_oc=AdpkX01sbHg00J4-BAgjCjQLch95BtpJb-UO-fE55ISNUS0aI8i0hdcxOJT5Rjz33T4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQRE78alAOVKip8wcNb9S1qCQ6S0whoOcWW9CjnN-a1bQ&oe=6B0C4F71"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bonk Slop", "keywords": ["gorilla", "multiplayer", "portals", "robots"], "long_description": "**Move like a gorilla.** No thumbsticks: push off the ground with your hands to run, climb walls and launch yourself through the air.\n\n**Bonk everything.** Punch friends and monsters, grab and throw stuff, ride shopping carts and tear walls off houses.\n\n**A whole world to mess around in**\n- Bonk Town: shops, houses, townsfolk and a bank\n- The Mining Cave: dig ore and gold, sell it at Dave's Shop, buy better gear\n- The Forgotten Factory: four floors of deformed monsters and loot\n- Giant robots, a Titan, and a showdown boss fight\n\n**Portals you can see through.** Become a portal-hopping mad scientist and open seamless portals: look through them, reach your arms in, and walk out somewhere else.\n\n**Play together.** Online rooms for up to five players with public matchmaking or private codes, or play solo.\n\nMade by a solo developer who is learning to code.", "short_description": "Swing your arms to run, climb and fling yourself around as a gorilla in Bonk Slop, a goofy VR brawler. Bonk your friends across town, mine the cave for gold, survive the Forgotten Factory's monsters, pilot giant robots, and hop through real see-through portals as a mad scientist. Play solo or online with up to five players."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/#privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Amazing Gorilla", "support_website_url": "https://github.com/Dummonk1403/bonk-slop/issues", "website_url": "https://dummonk1403.github.io/bonk-slop/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1983294882347338"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2579583032545599"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1793399460, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2579583032545599"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2029994934343999", "version": "2.76"}, "id": "2359923834780302", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2029994934343999"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Wind-Up Gubby (Bonk Toybox): turn the key on his back, set him down and he waddles off. He squeaks when he bumps something\n- Pocket Fan (Bonk Toybox): hold Trigger to spin it up and blow Bubble Blaster bubbles across the room\n- Ore Basket (Dave's): carry up to three loose ores by the handle. Tip it over to empty it\n- Be the Monster: The Twisted has a new, more detailed look", "created_date": 1795570480, "id": "2029994934343999", "version": "2.76", "version_code": 131, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2029994934343999"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "FIXES\n- A fix for the flat black squares on robot suit hands\n- Be the Monster: John's hands now line up with your real hands\n- Half-Robot equipment desk: pressing REQUEST KIT no longer shoves you back", "created_date": 1795507403, "id": "2029137427763083", "version": "2.75", "version_code": 130, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2029994934343999"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Five new items in the shops\n- Bubble Blaster (Bonk Toybox): pull the trigger for bubbles, hold it to blow one big bubble. Slap a bubble to pop it\n- Glow Boomerang (Bonk Toybox): flick it and let go. It curves out, comes back and leaves a glowing trail\n- Sticker Stamp (Bonk Toybox): trigger picks the design, then press it flat on a wall or floor to leave a sticker\n- Pocket Stool (Furniture Forge): trigger sets it on the floor, pat the seat to sit, grab the handle to fold it up\n- Crank Lantern (Dave's): turn the crank for light and hang it on a wall hook in Dave's shop or the cave\n\nFIXES\n- Fixed a slowdown that got worse the longer a room stayed open and the more players were in it\n- Buttons, shop baskets, dropped items and carts do less work each frame", "created_date": 1795494932, "id": "2029003847776441", "version": "2.74", "version_code": 129, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2029994934343999"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- Two new free monsters in Be the Monster: Gravlock and The Twisted\n- Gravlock: squeeze left grip twice to turn your left hand into a gravity gun. Aim at a survivor and hold left trigger to pull them to you\n- The Twisted: press Y to Blend In and look like a normal survivor. Press Y again or attack to snap back\n- Both start with 750 health. Their health bar shows at 250\n- Monsters are faster: joystick monsters by 50%, arm monsters by 15%\n- A part now stretches like rubber before it comes off, and snaps back if the monster lets go", "created_date": 1795476888, "id": "2028816134461879", "version": "2.73", "version_code": 128, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1983294875680672", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2029994934343999"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2359923834780302"}]}, "change_log": "NEW\n- The spawn house is bigger: wider and deeper, with more open floor\n- Two tall chairs at the chess table, one for White and one for Black\n- Press SIT on the plate beside a chair to sit down, and STAND to get up\n- Sitting on a chair takes that side of the board for you, in 1V1 and PLAY BOT", "created_date": 1795417695, "id": "2028100474533445", "version": "2.72", "version_code": 127, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}